> I love the summer bounty[!] The fresh vegetables and fruit[ are so] colorful[ and] succulent, who can[ resist eating these] vibrant beauties[?] Our bodies thrive[ on] raw plant-based foods[.] I think this is why our creator made fruits and[ vegetables] look soo enticing[! As]king yourself “How can I[ get] this[ more] of these beauties into my diet?” Then follow me over the next few weeks because I will be[ preparing] raw plant-based recipes[.] Summer[ is] the best time to set started – you�[�]ll beat the heat (in and out of the kitchen[)] and[ eat] seasonally at the same time[!]
